msgstr "線を書き出す"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write color pass"
msgstr "色を書き出す"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write light pass"
msgstr "光を書き出す"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write shadow pass"
msgstr "影を書き出す"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "File Output path"
msgstr "ファイル出力先"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "generator color"
msgstr "生成カラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "mask color"
msgstr "マスクカラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "line color"
msgstr "線カラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "material color"
msgstr "マテリアルカラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "bone color"
msgstr "ボーンカラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Color seed"
msgstr "配色シード"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Choose the sharp-edge angle automatically from the mesh's dihedral-angle distribution (per object)"
msgstr "メッシュの面の角度の分布から、線を出す辺の角度をオブジェクトごとに自動で決めます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Lowest angle the auto threshold may pick for a model that has no structural edges at all. Too low and a smoothly curving surface gets cut across at an arbitrary place"
msgstr "角の無いなめらかなモデルで、自動の角度がここより下がらないようにします。低すぎると曲面が変な所で切られます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Treat UV seams and material borders as island boundaries in addition to the edge angle"
msgstr "辺の角度に加えて、UVシームとマテリアルの境目でも島を分けます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Merge islands smaller than this % of total mesh area into their largest neighbor (0 = off)"
msgstr "メッシュ全体の面積に対してこの%より小さい島を、隣の一番大きい島にまとめます(0 = しない)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Add a faint normal-based relief inside each island so that smooth ridges (a brow, a fold) get a line. 0 = off"
msgstr "島の中に法線の向きで薄い濃淡をつけ、なめらかな稜線(眉、服のしわ)にも線を出します。0 = しない"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How far to look when deciding the 'overall direction' of a surface, as a fraction of the object size. Smaller = thinner lines on finer features"
msgstr "面の「大まかな向き」を決めるときに見る範囲(オブジェクトの大きさに対する割合)。小さいほど細かい形に線が出ます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "For objects that carry a Subdivision modifier, cut islands at a low angle and then dissolve every boundary that is not a sharp edge. The modelling cage stops showing up as lines while the real creases stay"
msgstr "サブディビジョンが付いたオブジェクトは、低い角度で島を切ってからシャープ以外の境目を消します。モデリング用の網目は線にならず、本当の折り目は残ります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Smooth the paint color across low-angle edges so the mesh grid on subdivided surfaces stops turning into lines. Sharp edges keep their hard step (0 = off)"
msgstr "角度の浅い辺をまたいで色をなめらかにし、細分化した面の網目が線にならないようにします。シャープな辺の段差は残します(0 = しない)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Only edges below this dihedral angle get smoothed. Edges above it keep a hard color step, so their lines stay"
msgstr "この角度より浅い辺だけをなめらかにします。深い辺は色の段差が残るので線も残ります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Select vertex color type."
msgstr "頂点カラーのタイプを選びます。"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Thin out lines where they have merged into solid black (typically the far background of a large set). 0 = off, no change to the image"
msgstr "線が黒くつぶれた所(広いセットの遠景など)を間引きます。0 = しない(絵は変わりません)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How far to look when measuring how crowded the lines are, in pixels. Larger = only wide black areas are thinned"
msgstr "線の混み具合を測るときに見る範囲(ピクセル)。大きいほど広い黒だけを間引きます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How crowded an area must be before it is thinned. Lower = starts working on sparser lines"
msgstr "どれだけ混んだら間引くか。低いほど少ない線から効き始めます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Scale the line-detection thresholds inside the node group. Lower = weaker edges also become solid lines (1.0 = raw node)"
msgstr "ノードグループの中の線を出すしきい値を掛け算します。低いほど弱い境目も線になります(1.0 = ノードのまま)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Thicken the line where the shape is recessed and thin it where it is open, using the ambient-occlusion pass. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "アンビエントオクルージョンを使い、くぼんだ所の線を太く、開いた所を細くします。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "While line weight is on, allow fewer islands so the mesh is cut more coarsely. A thin rim seen edge-on stops turning every mesh ring into its own line. 1.0 = do not change it"
msgstr "線の強弱が有効な間は島を減らし、メッシュを粗く切ります。横から見た薄い縁で、網目の輪がそれぞれ線になるのを防ぎます。1.0 = 変えない"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "While line weight is on, raise the line-detection threshold by this factor so fewer, cleaner lines are thickened. 1.0 = do not change it"
msgstr "線の強弱が有効な間は、線を出すしきい値をこの倍率で上げ、少なくきれいな線だけを太くします。1.0 = 変えない"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Multiplier on the step widths. 1.0 = 12/8/5/3/2 px before the 50% shrink. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "太さの段の幅にかける倍率。1.0 = 50%縮小前で 12/8/5/3/2 px。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How dark a pixel must be to count as line before thickening. Lower = faint lines survive"
msgstr "太らせる前に、どれだけ濃ければ線とみなすか。低いほど薄い線も残ります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Share of the silhouette covered by lines, read by the threshold measurement. Dense models get a lower maximum width automatically"
msgstr "しきい値を測ったときに読んだ、シルエットの中で線が占める割合。線の多いモデルは最大の太さが自動で下がります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Shrink the line weight with distance so far objects keep the thin base line only. 0 = off"
msgstr "遠いほど線の強弱を弱め、奥の物は細い基本線だけにします。0 = しない"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Raise the line threshold with distance so weak lines drop out far away. 1 = off, 3 = far threshold x3"
msgstr "遠いほど線のしきい値を上げ、奥の弱い線を減らします。1 = しない、3 = 奥でしきい値3倍"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Fade far lines toward the paper, like aerial perspective. 0 = off"
msgstr "空気遠近のように、奥の線を紙の色へ薄めます。0 = しない"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Camera distance where the far treatment begins. Measured with the thresholds (5th percentile of line depth)"
msgstr "奥の扱いが始まるカメラからの距離。しきい値と一緒に測ります(線の奥行きの5パーセンタイル)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Camera distance where the far treatment is full. Measured with the thresholds (95th percentile of line depth)"
msgstr "奥の扱いが最大になるカメラからの距離。しきい値と一緒に測ります(線の奥行きの95パーセンタイル)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Also paint a second, finer split (the precise/mech one) and lay those lines over the drawing at this strength. 0 = off. Needs STEP0 again (it paints twice)"
msgstr "精密(メカ)の細かい塗り分けももう1枚塗り、その線をこの濃さで重ねます。0 = しない。STEP0 をやり直すと反映されます(2回塗ります)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Paint small islands (leaf cards) in this many spatial clumps instead of one colour per leaf. 0 = off. Needs STEP1 again. Maple 4-8, palm 1"
msgstr "小さな島(葉の板)を1枚ずつ塗らず、この数の房にまとめて塗ります。0 = しない。STEP1 をやり直すと反映されます。カエデは4〜8、ヤシは1"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Fill holes narrower than this (pixels at 200%) before detecting lines, so sky seen between leaves does not outline every leaf. 0 = off. Needs STEP3 again"
msgstr "線を出す前に、これより狭いすき間(200%でのピクセル)を埋めます。葉の間から見える空で葉が1枚ずつ縁取られるのを防ぎます。0 = しない。STEP3 をやり直すと反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Off: open areas (the outline) are thick and lines thin as they enter a crease, like a pen drawing. On: the reverse"
msgstr "オフ: ペン画のように、開いた所(輪郭)が太く、くぼみに入ると細くなります。オン: その逆"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How dark the darkest line is, as seen on screen. 1 = black, 0.75 = dark grey. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "一番濃い線の濃さ。1 = 黒、0.75 = 濃いグレー。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Blur the line edges by this many pixels (at 200%) after anti-aliasing, before the 50% downscale. 0 = SMAA only"
msgstr "アンチエイリアスのあと、50%縮小の前に、線の縁をこのピクセル数(200%で)ぼかします。0 = SMAA だけ"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Also vary darkness by step: the thinnest step fades to grey while the thickest stays black. 0 = width only"
msgstr "段ごとに濃さも変えます。一番細い段はグレーに、一番太い段は黒のまま。0 = 太さだけ"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Lift the ink after the 50% shrink so the thin steps stay black"
msgstr "50%縮小のあとで線を濃くし、細い段も黒く残します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Where lines are packed together, do not thicken them. A thin rim seen edge-on turns the mesh rings into several parallel lines that would otherwise merge into one blob. 0 = off"
msgstr "線が詰まった所は太らせません。横から見た薄い縁は網目の輪が平行な線になり、太らせると1つの黒い塊になるためです。0 = しない"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How far to look when deciding that lines are packed, in pixels of the render (before the 50% shrink)"
msgstr "線が詰まっているかを決めるときに見る範囲(50%縮小前のピクセル)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How packed an area must be before it stops being thickened. Lower = starts working on sparser lines"
msgstr "どれだけ詰まったら太らせるのをやめるか。低いほど少ない線から効き始めます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Blur the cavity map before it drives the width. EEVEE's AO is ray-traced and grainy; the grain turns a single stroke into a dashed line. Larger = smoother taper along a stroke"
msgstr "太さを決める前にくぼみの画をぼかします。EEVEE の AO は粒が粗く、1本の線が破線になるためです。大きいほど線に沿った入り抜きがなめらかになります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How far to look when deciding how recessed a point is, as a fraction of the scene size. Not in scene units: an absolute value stops working as soon as the model is bigger or smaller"
msgstr "どれだけくぼんでいるかを決めるときに見る範囲(シーンの大きさに対する割合)。絶対値にするとモデルの大きさが変わるだけで効かなくなるため、割合にしています"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Step boundary on 1 - AO. Measure it per cut"
msgstr "1 − AO の段の境目。カットごとに測ります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Render at 200% resolution and scale the compositor output back to 50%, turning 2px lines into crisp 1px lines. Applies to the Composite output and File Output slots"
msgstr "200%の解像度でレンダし、コンポジットの出力を50%に戻して、2pxの線をくっきりした1pxにします。コンポジット出力とファイル出力に効きます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "What to show under the lines. Both work the same way: they change what feeds the node group, so materials are never touched"
msgstr "線の下に何を敷くか。どれもノードグループに入れる物を変えるだけで、マテリアルには触りません"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Grey shading from the diffuse light, with lines on top. Texture patterns are not carried over"
msgstr "拡散光のグレーの陰影に線を重ねます。テクスチャの模様は出ません"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How dark the shadows may get in mono preview. 0 crushes them to black and the lines disappear"
msgstr "モノクロプレビューで影をどこまで暗くするか。0 だと黒くつぶれて線が見えなくなります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Temporarily replace all materials with a flat white emission (AOV-enabled) to preview pure line art. Original materials are backed up per object and fully restored when turned off"
msgstr "すべてのマテリアルを一時的に白い放射(AOV付き)に置き換え、線画だけを見ます。元のマテリアルはオブジェクトごとに保存し、オフにすると元に戻します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "While white preview is on, leave real glass materials (Transmission / low Alpha) untouched so you can still see through windows"
msgstr "白プレビューの間も本物のガラス(透過・低いアルファ)は置き換えず、窓の向こうが見えるようにします"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Add a File Output node to the generated compositor tree that writes the selected passes as PNGs"
msgstr "生成したコンポジットにファイル出力ノードを足し、選んだパスを PNG で書き出します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write the line art to line.png"
msgstr "線画を line.png に書き出します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write the flat color output to color.png"
msgstr "ベタの色を color.png に書き出します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write the diffuse direct light pass to light.png. Easier to composite than the shadow pass"
msgstr "拡散の直接光を light.png に書き出します。影のパスより合成しやすいです"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Write the shadow pass to shadow.png. EEVEE's shadow pass is often noisy"
msgstr "影のパスを shadow.png に書き出します。EEVEE の影のパスはノイズが出やすいです"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Base path for the File Output node"
msgstr "ファイル出力ノードの出力先"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Insert Anti-Aliasing node before Composite"
msgstr "コンポジットの前にアンチエイリアスノードを入れます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "AOV Generator Color"
msgstr "AOV 生成カラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "AOV Mask Color(White erases lines)"
msgstr "AOV マスクカラー(白く塗った所の線が消えます)"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "AOV Line Color"
msgstr "AOV 線カラー"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Increasing the scale scatters island colors more randomly."
msgstr "大きくするほど、島の色がばらけます。"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Minimum RGB distance between neighboring islands (0–1.732). Lower values allow similar colors."
msgstr "隣り合う島の色の最小RGB距離(0〜1.732)。低いほど似た色を許します。"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How many times to retry when a color already exists"
msgstr "同じ色がすでにあるとき、選び直す回数の上限"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Generate a new random seed every run. Turn this off to reproduce exactly the same island colors."
msgstr "実行のたびに新しいシードにします。オフにすると同じ塗り分けを再現できます。"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Seed for island color generation. The same seed with the same mesh reproduces the same colors."
msgstr "島の色を決めるシード。同じメッシュに同じシードなら同じ色になります。"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Give touching parts (objects) different brightness bands in mecha_color so part boundaries (hairline, collar) become lines; bone_color stays a pure weight blend and the node composites both channels"
msgstr "接しているパーツ(オブジェクト)ごとに mecha_color の明るさの帯を変え、パーツの境目(髪の生え際、襟)を線にします。bone_color はウェイトのなめらかな混色のままで、ノードが両方を合成します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Comma-separated bone names whose region boundary should be a hard step in bone_color (so a line appears there, e.g. 'head' for a chin line). Empty = all soft blending"
msgstr "bone_color で境目をくっきり分けるボーン名(カンマ区切り)。そこに線が出ます(例: あごの線なら 'head')。空 = すべてなめらかに混ぜる"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Color used by Half Fill"
msgstr "半分塗りで使う色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Include this camera in FreePencil's 'Render checked cameras' batch"
msgstr "FreePencil の「チェックしたカメラをレンダリング」にこのカメラを入れます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Fade dense lines"
msgstr "詰まった線を薄く"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Lighten lines where they are packed together on screen (shutters, railings, fire escapes), so dense detail reads as fine texture instead of a black blob. 0 = off. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "画面上で線が詰まった所(シャッター、手すり、外階段)を薄くし、細かい物が黒い塊にならず細かな模様に見えるようにします。0 = しない。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Fade fine stripes"
msgstr "細かすぎる縞を薄く"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Far away, blur rows of lines that are packed finer than the pixels (shutters, louvers, railings seen from a low angle) into a light haze, keeping floor bands and outlines. Only rows running one way are touched, not leaves. Stops the far end from crushing and flickering. 0 = off. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "奥で画素より細かく並んだ線(低い視点から見たシャッター・ルーバー・手すり)をぼかして淡いもやにし、階の帯や輪郭は残します。向きのそろった縞だけに効き、木の葉は触りません。奥がつぶれたり、動かしたときにちらついたりするのを防ぎます。0 = しない。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Paint as"
msgstr "塗り方"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How STEP1 paints this object in the hand-drawn finishes (Character / Background). Precise always splits by angle"
msgstr "手描き系の仕上がり(キャラ・手描き背景)で、STEP1 がこのオブジェクトをどう塗るか。精密はいつも角度で分けます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自動"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Rigged objects are painted as characters, unless most vertices follow a single bone (a robot)"
msgstr "リグ付きはキャラとして塗ります。ただし頂点の大半がボーン1本に固定されている物(ロボット)はメカとして塗ります"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Split by edge angle and keep every panel line, even when rigged"
msgstr "リグ付きでも角度で分け、パネルの線を全部出します"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Character"
msgstr "キャラ"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Coarse paint: one color per part, joints blended by bone weights. Also works without a rig"
msgstr "ざっくり塗り: パーツごとに1色、関節はボーンのウェイトでぼかします。リグが無くても使えます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Auto result: "
msgstr "自動の判定: "

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Fine lines: run STEP0 with Background"
msgstr "細い線: 仕上がり「手描き背景」で STEP0 を押すと使えます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Far lines"
msgstr "奥の線を控えめに"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How much to hold back far lines: thinner, fewer and lighter with distance. 1 = the Background default, 0 = off. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "遠くの線をどれだけ控えるか。遠いほど細く・少なく・薄くします。1 = 手描き背景の既定、0 = しない。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Crush relief"
msgstr "つぶれ軽減"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Keep packed detail from crushing into black: fade lines that are packed together (railings, shutters) and blur rows of stripes that get finer than the pixels far away. Outlines stay. 1 = the Background default, 0 = off. Updates the drawing right away"
msgstr "細かい物が黒くつぶれないようにします。詰まった線（手すり・シャッター）を薄くし、奥で画素より細かくなった縞をぼかします。輪郭は残ります。1 = 手描き背景の既定、0 = しない。動かすとすぐ絵に反映されます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Press STEP3 after changing these"
msgstr "変えたら STEP3 を押し直してください"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Cel (shadow and color)"
msgstr "セル（影と色）"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Two-tone cel shadow and pale material colors under the lines, with a sky color behind. Works whatever the materials are (the light is taken from a white surface)"
msgstr "線の下に、2 階調のセルの影と、材質の色を薄めた色を敷きます。物の外は空の色。材質がどんな作りでも影が出ます（光は白い面で取ります）"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Shadow threshold"
msgstr "影のしきい値"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Where light turns into shadow (1 = the brightest spot). Raise it for more shadow"
msgstr "どこから影にするか（1 = 一番明るい所）。上げると影が増えます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Smooth shadow edges"
msgstr "影の縁をなめらかに"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Blur the light before cutting it into two tones (px). Removes speckled shadows and wavy edges"
msgstr "2 階調に切る前に光をぼかします（px）。点のような影や、縁のがたつきが消えます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Shadow color"
msgstr "影の色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Color multiplied into the shadow side"
msgstr "影の側に掛ける色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Paleness"
msgstr "色の薄さ"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "How far the material colors are pushed toward white. 0 keeps the material color"
msgstr "材質の色をどれだけ白に寄せるか。0 で材質の色のまま"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Sky color"
msgstr "空の色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Fill the background with a sky color. Off keeps it transparent (for compositing elsewhere)"
msgstr "物の外を空の色で塗ります。切ると透過のまま（別のソフトで合成するとき）"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Sky"
msgstr "空"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Background color behind the objects"
msgstr "物の後ろの色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Shadow line"
msgstr "影の線"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Draw a colored line along the shadow edge"
msgstr "影の境目に色の線を引きます"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Shadow line color"
msgstr "影の線の色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Color of the line along the shadow edge"
msgstr "影の境目の線の色"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Shadow line width"
msgstr "影の線の太さ"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Width of the shadow line (px)"
msgstr "影の線の太さ（px）"

msgctxt "*"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "太さ"
